  unitName: Divine Destroyer Rize
  unitId: 40574
  unitNumber: 917
  description: A demon feared for her overwhelming destructive power. However, she
    had absolutely no interest in how others perceived her. Ruling relative opinions
    as useless, as well as supremacy and conquest, she only did as she wished. In
    comparison to other demons who continued fighting incessantly, she seemed almost
    like a creature from another world. She is rumored to have said "I have no interest
    in any other beings. Having interest in anything at all makes no sense."
  summonDesc: "This is worthless\u2026 I have absolutely no interest in this fragile
    world..."
  fusionDesc: Don't try to make me sympathize. I'm gonna do whatever I want. No matter
    what you do to me.
